  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAccumulatedDepreciationOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:14pt;"&gt;※５  有形固定資産の減価償却累計額&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:9.5pt;font-size:9.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
